      "description": "Every control the screen offers. `equip`/`unequip`/`lock`/`unlock` submit one command each; `enhance` and `merge` open a page and `enhanceOnce` and `mergeConfirm` submit from it; `salvage` asks and `salvageConfirm` submits; `select` enters the batch mode, `cancel` leaves it, `back` turns the sheet a page back, `close` leaves the screen, `clearFilter` widens the grid.",
